export const BREEZY=Object.freeze({"name":"Breezy","special":"Robot Transform Blast","kind":"robotBlast","duration":2.21,"range":1100,"color":"#ffe047","glow":"rgba(255,209,55,.4)"});
const phases=[[0.18,16],[0.4,17],[0.58,18],[0.78,19],[0.94,20],[1.2,21],[1.38,22],[1.56,20],[1.69,18],[1.86,17],[2.08,23],[2.21,0]];
export function createBreezySpecial(a){return {kind:BREEZY.kind,owner:a.id,facing:a.facing,originX:a.x,x:a.x,age:0,ttl:BREEZY.duration,duration:BREEZY.duration,active:true,delay:0,hitCount:0,fired:false};}
export function endBreezySpecial(g,a,s){s.active=false;s.ttl=0;if(a){a.vx=0;a.actionRemaining=0;g.setState(a,a.hp>0?"idle":"ko");}}
export function updateBreezySpecial(g,s,a,b){if(!a||!b){endBreezySpecial(g,a,s);return;}a.facing=s.facing;a.vx=0;if(s.ttl>1e-9){a.state="special";a.actionRemaining=Math.max(a.actionRemaining,s.ttl);}if(!s.fired&&s.age>=1.2){s.fired=true;const dx=(b.x-s.originX)*s.facing;if(dx>=-12&&dx<=BREEZY.range&&b.y<190&&g.hit(a,b,48,s.kind,420,.42,s.originX))s.hitCount=1;}if(s.ttl<=1e-9)endBreezySpecial(g,a,s);}
export function breezyPose(f,s){const t=Math.max(0,f.stateTime||0),p=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,f.attackProgress||0));let index=0;if(f.state==="special"){const age=s?.age??t;index=phases.find(([end])=>age<end)?.[1]??0;}else if(f.state==="punch")index=p<.24?12:p<.7?13:15;else if(f.state==="kick")index=p<.24?12:p<.7?14:15;else if(f.state==="block")index=12;else if(f.state==="ko")index=7;else if(f.state==="hurt"||f.state==="grabbed"||f.state==="beltHeld")index=t<.13?15:7;else if(!f.grounded||f.state==="jump"||f.state==="fall")index=t<.075?8:(f.vy??0)>0?9:10;else if(f.breezyLandRemaining>0&&f.state==="idle")index=11;else if(f.state==="run"||f.state==="walk")index=[2,4,3,5,6,7][Math.floor(t*(f.state==="run"?13:10))%6];else index=Math.floor(t*2)%2;return {key:"breezy",index};}
export function drawBreezySpecial(ctx,s,g,ground){if(s.age<1.2||s.age>=1.56)return;const start=1.2,end=1.56,fade=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,(s.age-start)*45,(end-s.age)*12));const x=s.originX+s.facing*73,y=ground-136,len=BREEZY.range;ctx.save();ctx.translate(x,y);ctx.scale(s.facing,1);ctx.globalAlpha=fade;ctx.lineCap="round";for(const [width,color] of [[45,"#168aff"],[24,"#75dfff"],[9,"#f0fdff"]]){ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=width;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(0,0);ctx.lineTo(len,0);ctx.stroke();}ctx.fillStyle="#eaffff";ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(0,0,15,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.restore();}
